Design inspiration and acknowledgements
=======================================

We thank the wis2hauler contributors (https://github.com/golfvert/wis2hauler)
for design inspiration informing OpenECPDS's WIS2 acquisition improvements,
particularly notification identity and content-integrity verification.
The OpenECPDS implementation is independently developed.
